  "stageId": "act14side_05",
  "title": "猎场",
  "storyCode": "BI-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8b8a45735aca396773b602e7d0d66f4fdcaead8b1653eb24117100ddfc91130e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿克托斯大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！我在，圣女大人有何吩咐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必如此紧张，阿克托斯大人，我并非食人猛兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管怎么说，这是您第一次亲自参与圣猎。不光是我，您看看这些战士们，在圣女大人您面前大家都绷紧了，想好好表现一番！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......作为圣女，与耶拉冈德的战士们一同参与圣猎，我认为这是我应当做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您这话说得有理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不说我了。我见您从狩猎开始时，就一直像是有什么心事，若是有什么想问的，就请直接问吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，瞒不过圣女大人，您见笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若您不介意，可以将我当成一个朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，我也会将您当成一个朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我心中，也把圣女大人您当作一个朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然如此，就让我们像朋友似的说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白了，那么恕我直言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想知道，圣女大人，究竟是怎么看待还政一事的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您很爽快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朋友之间，自当如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我佩尔罗契家的人论战斗，不会输给布朗陶和希瓦艾什，但论阴谋诡计，实在不是这两家的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弯弯绕绕，遮遮掩掩绝非我的风格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您说得不错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，我的朋友，还是得请您原谅我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在回答您的问题之前，我需要先向您确认一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人请说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿克托斯大人，您是一位忠勇、虔诚的战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我清楚您率直、爽快，同时我也知晓，您绝不是真的毫无考虑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然您说朋友之间理应不遮不掩，那么我亦当效仿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我想知道，一直以来，为什么您会如此坚定地反对恩希欧迪斯的开放政策？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我是个粗人，圣女大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论恩希欧迪斯将他的所谓开放吹得有多好，有多吸引人，我要的不是那些夸夸其谈，不是那些漂亮话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只看他带来了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我看到的是涌进我们家中的毫无信仰的外国人，是打着发展旗号对土地山川的破坏，是在他的领地里工作后日渐失去信仰的谢拉格人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......他带进来的那些东西是好用，他因此赚了很多钱，造了很多大房子，我当然知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是如果人人都学他那样，为了所谓的发展，就把信仰抛在脑后，那么这片土地会变成什么样子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶拉冈德既然令我佩尔罗契家守卫谢拉格，那我阿克托斯就决不能容忍有任何人，以任何方式想要将其破坏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......阿克托斯大人的想法我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么该我回答您的问题了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯大人提出要将核心领地尽数交于我手，此事事出突然，确实在我的意料之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人果然也不知情吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确实，在此之前，我对他竟有这种打算一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不论恩希欧迪斯大人究竟是出于何种考量，才提出还政一事，就结果而言，我并不认为这是一个很坏的发展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我坐在蔓珠院中，日日夜夜看着人们向耶拉冈德祈祷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有一点我比恩希欧迪斯大人要清楚，那就是——谢拉格还无法失去信仰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既做出了这样的决定，接下来的许多事情，我想，就不再是谁个人说了便能算数的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "意外总会发生，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若恩希欧迪斯大人没有提前料想到这一点，那就是他的不是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......行，其他的我不管，但我信您这句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "实不相瞒，您刚刚说话时，直到听到您最后的话之前，我都觉得自己好像不是在与圣女大人对话，而是在面对另一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许这是我多心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果会让阿克托斯大人产生这样的感觉，我必须说，这让我感到难过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我绝不会否认，我也姓希瓦艾什。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，成为圣女后我的一切便与俗世割离。令这个姓氏于我而言不再有意义的，却也正是恩希欧迪斯大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "野兽们终于按捺不住了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有人准备狩猎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商人A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人画像，圣女大人刺绣，圣女大人雕像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商人A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢拉格人的信仰象征，还犹豫什么，现在就将耶拉冈德的祝福请回家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
