          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "修士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_268",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在第一百位少女的呼唤下，耶拉冈德终于宽恕了谢拉格的人民，严冬终于终结。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "修士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_268",
